  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oversight of Irrigation Activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide implementation support and oversight responsibilities for irritation projects in countries such as Moldova, Mali, Burkina Faso, Ghana, Senegal and Morocco. Assist MCC by reviewing and providing comments on key implementation deliverables, processes and actual performance during the start-up and full implementation of Compact activities. Guide MCC and MCA entities to resolve strategic and technical decisions.</narrative>
  </description>
